      "title": "Oprav FQDN komponent",
      "description": "Kontejnerové služby (Fleet components, Instance components, Identity broker, VCF services runtime, VCF Automation, VCF services runtime pro VCF Automation) nesmí mít v FQDN velká písmena ani doménu .local. Velká písmena v těchto polích nasazení shodí (známý problém). U vCenteru, ESX, NSX, SDDC Manageru a VCF Operations .local povolené je – ty neměň.",
      "actions": [{ "kind": "deployment-event", "event": "edit" }],
      "completion": { "kind": "codes-absent", "check": "validateBringupSpec", "codes": ["FQDN_NOT_LOWERCASE", "FQDN_LOCAL_DOMAIN"] },
      "points": 15,
      "specRefs": [
        { "spec": "20-deployment", "section": "§3.5", "sources": ["S14", "S19", "S55"] },
        { "spec": "20-deployment", "section": "§5.1", "sources": ["S14", "S19"] },
        { "spec": "20-deployment", "section": "§5.3", "sources": ["S31"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-local-quiz",
      "order": 5,
      "title": "Kde .local smí být?",
      "description": "Kolega z jiného týmu tvrdí, že .local je ve VCF zakázané úplně a chce přejmenovat i vCenter a ESX hosty ve svém labu.",
      "actions": [{ "kind": "quiz" }],
      "completion": {
        "kind": "quiz",
        "question": "Které komponenty mohou podle dokumentace používat FQDN v doméně .local? (více odpovědí)",
        "options": [
          "vCenter",
          "ESX hosty",
          "VCF services runtime",
          "VCF Identity Broker",
          "NSX Manager"
        ],
        "correct": [0, 1, 4],
        "explanation": "„Traditional virtual appliances, such as vCenter, ESX hosts, NSX Manager, SDDC Manager, and VCF Operations, continue to operate with .local domains.“ Naopak „Containerized services, such as VCF management services, VCF Automation, VCF Identity Broker, and VMware vSphere Supervisor, do not support .local domains.“ Zákaz .local tedy není obecný – platí jen pro kontejnerové služby."
      },
      "points": 5,
      "specRefs": [
        { "spec": "20-deployment", "section": "§3.5", "sources": ["S19", "S55"] },
        { "spec": "20-deployment", "section": "§5.1", "sources": ["S19"] }
      ]
    },
